  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform rectangular thin sheet <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> of mass <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math> has length <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and breadth <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math>, as shown in the figure. If the shaded portion <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> is cut-off, the coordinates of the centre of mass of the remaining portion will be:<br />\r<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/5a436ad8-0ead-490c-9934-3b2d04cf0495-image15.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 136px;\" />",
